<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Proof-backed offline-first synchronization for browser, mobile, native, and BEAM runtimes."><meta name="theme-color" content="#071713"><title>Opto Sync — local now, consistent deliberately</title></head><body>
<header><a class="brand" href="/"><b>OS</b><span>Opto Sync</span></a><nav><a href="#platform">Protocol</a><a href="#clients">Clients</a><a href="https://github.com/opto-sync">GitHub ↗</a></nav></header><main>
<section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Offline-first runtime · Proof-backed</p><h1>Local instantly. <em>Consistent deliberately.</em></h1><p class="lede">Opto Sync gives applications durable optimistic writes, deterministic reconciliation, restart-safe queues, and explicit protocol cycles across IndexedDB, SQLite, Postgres, Supabase, HTTP, and background runtimes.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="https://github.com/opto-sync/opto-sync-clients">Explore the clients ↗</a><a href="#clients">Choose a language</a></div><ul><li>One pinned C core</li><li>Four official clients</li><li>Commit-ordered HTTP truth</li></ul></div><div class="visual"><span class="grid"></span><div class="layer local"><small>LOCAL VIEW</small><strong>buy milk ✓</strong><i>optimistic + durable</i></div><div class="layer queue"><small>QUEUE</small><strong>mutation 0042</strong><i>pending</i></div><div class="layer remote"><small>REMOTE</small><strong>checkpoint 188</strong><i>authoritative</i></div><div class="core"><small>RECONCILE</small><strong>syncer.c 0.2.1</strong><i>one merge contract</i></div><svg viewBox="0 0 500 400"><path d="M95 95C260 80 240 200 250 200S250 320 405 305M95 305C240 315 240 200 250 200S260 85 405 95"/></svg></div></section>
<section class="metrics"><div><b>4</b><span>official client languages</span></div><div><b>3</b><span>write strategies</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>pinned merge core</span></div><div><b>0</b><span>hidden transport policy</span></div></section>
<section id="platform" class="platform"><p class="eyebrow">The rule that prevents flicker</p><h2>Render `localView`, not raw incoming state.</h2><p class="intro">Incoming server state does not know about mutations still waiting to push. Opto Sync replays unconfirmed writes over authoritative state, so an optimistic edit never disappears merely because a newer server timestamp arrived first.</p><div class="features">{features.map(([t,b],i)=><article><small>{String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</small><h3>{t}</h3><p>{b}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section id="clients" class="sdk" data-sdk><div><p class="eyebrow">Official client workbench</p><h2>Use the runtime you already ship.</h2><p class="intro">Every package owns its durable queue and host integration while delegating reconciliation to the exact same pinned core.</p><a class="source" href="https://github.com/opto-sync/opto-sync-clients">Browse opto-sync-clients ↗</a></div><div class="workbench"><div class="toolbar"><label><span>Language</span><select aria-label="Select client language" data-language>{samples.map((s,i)=><option value={s.id} selected={i===0}>{s.label}</option>)}</select></label><code data-file>{samples[0]?.file ?? "todo.ts"}</code><button data-copy type="button">Copy</button></div>{samples.map((s,i)=><article data-sample={s.id} data-name={s.file} hidden={i!==0}><pre tabindex="0"><code>{s.code}</code></pre><p>{s.note}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="closing"><p class="eyebrow">Optimism without wishful thinking</p><h2>Make offline behavior a protocol, not a pile of retries.</h2><a href="https://github.com/opto-sync">Open the organization ↗</a></section></main><footer><span>© 2026 Opto Sync</span><a href="https://github.com/opto-sync/opto-sync-clients">Client packages</a></footer>
<script is:inline>document.querySelectorAll('[data-sdk]').forEach((r)=>{const s=r.querySelector('[data-language]'),f=r.querySelector('[data-file]'),c=r.querySelector('[data-copy]'),p=[...r.querySelectorAll('[data-sample]')];const show=(id)=>p.forEach((x)=>{const a=x.dataset.sample===id;x.hidden=!a;if(a)f.textContent=x.dataset.name||''});s?.addEventListener('change',(e)=>show(e.target.value));c?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const a=p.find((x)=>!x.hidden),t=a?.querySelector('code')?.textContent||'';try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(t);c.textContent='Copied'}catch{a?.querySelector('pre')?.focus();c.textContent='Select code'}setTimeout(()=>c.textContent='Copy',1200)})});</script>
<style>:root{--accent:#059669;--hot:#06b6d4;--ink:#071713;--muted:#5d716a;--paper:#f4fbf8}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ecfdf5,var(--paper) 36rem);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.6 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}a{color:inherit}header,main,footer{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:auto}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:1.1rem 0}.brand{display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;font-weight:900;text-decoration:none}.brand b{display:grid;width:2.35rem;aspect-ratio:1;place-items:center;border-radius:.75rem;background:var(--ink);color:white;font-size:.7rem}nav{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:800}nav a{text-decoration:none}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.04fr .96fr;gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,7rem);align-items:center;min-height:720px;padding:5rem 0}.eyebrow{margin:0;color:var(--accent);font:800 .7rem/1 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.17em;text-transform:uppercase}h1{max-width:12ch;margin:.8rem 0 1.25rem;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,7rem);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.075em}h1 em{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--accent),var(--hot));background-clip:text;color:transparent;font-style:normal}.lede,.intro{max-width:47rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem}.actions{display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:2rem 0}.actions a,.closing a{padding:.75rem 1rem;border:1px solid #0f172a1b;border-radius:.75rem;font-weight:850;text-decoration:none}.primary{background:var(--ink);color:white}.hero ul{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;padding:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;list-style:none}.hero li:before{content:'◆';margin-right:.4rem;color:var(--accent)}.visual{position:relative;min-height:32rem;overflow:hidden;border-radius:2rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,#10b98145,transparent 39%),linear-gradient(145deg,#061611,#102d29);box-shadow:0 35px 90px #064e3b40}.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(#ffffff0c 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#ffffff0c 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:2.4rem 2.4rem}.visual svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;fill:none;stroke:#34d39980;stroke-width:2}.layer,.core{position:absolute;z-index:2;display:grid;padding:1rem;border:1px solid #ffffff25;border-radius:1rem;background:#08251fdf;color:#6ee7b7;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);font:700 .64rem/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace}.layer strong,.core strong{color:white}.layer i,.core i{font-style:normal}.local{top:9%;left:7%}.queue{top:9%;right:7%}.remote{bottom:9%;right:7%}.core{left:50%;bottom:9%;width:13rem;transform:translateX(-50%)}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #064e3b18;border-radius:1.15rem;background:#ffffffc9}.metrics div{display:grid;padding:1.2rem}.metrics div+div{border-left:1px solid #064e3b18}.metrics b{font-size:1.3rem}.metrics span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem}.platform{padding:8rem 0}.platform h2,.sdk h2,.closing h2{max-width:15ch;margin:.55rem 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,5rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.06em}.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;margin-top:3rem}.features article{min-height:14rem;padding:1.3rem;border:1px solid #064e3b14;border-radius:1.1rem;background:#ffffffc5}.features small{color:var(--accent);font:800 .68rem/1 ui-monospace,monospace}.features h3{margin:2.1rem 0 .55rem}.features p{color:var(--muted)}.sdk{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.78fr) minmax(31rem,1.22fr);gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem);align-items:center;margin:3rem 0 9rem}.source{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;color:var(--accent);font-weight:850;text-decoration:none}.workbench{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #ffffff24;border-radius:1.25rem;background:#061611;color:#d1fae5;box-shadow:0 32px 90px #064e3b40}.toolbar{display:flex;gap:.8rem;align-items:end;padding:.85rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff18;background:#0b251f}.toolbar label{display:grid;gap:.25rem}.toolbar label span{color:#6ee7b7;font:700 .6rem/1 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}.toolbar select,.toolbar button{border:1px solid #ffffff28;border-radius:.58rem;background:#12372f;color:white;padding:.5rem .65rem;font:inherit}.toolbar button{margin-left:auto;cursor:pointer}.toolbar>code{align-self:center;color:#6ee7b7;font-size:.75rem}.workbench pre{overflow:auto;min-height:23rem;max-height:31rem;margin:0;padding:1.2rem;font:500 .82rem/1.7 ui-monospace,monospace;white-space:pre}.workbench article>p{margin:0;padding:.8rem 1.2rem 1rem;border-top:1px solid #ffffff15;color:#6ee7b7;font-size:.78rem}.closing{margin-bottom:2rem;padding:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem);border-radius:1.8rem;background:linear-gradient(125deg,var(--accent),var(--hot));color:white}.closing .eyebrow{color:#ffffffc7}.closing a{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;background:white;color:var(--ink)}footer{display:flex;gap:1rem;padding:1.5rem 0 3rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem}footer span{margin-right:auto}footer a{text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:900px){.hero,.sdk{grid-template-columns:1fr}.features{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:650px){nav a:not(:last-child){display:none}.visual{min-height:26rem}.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.features{grid-template-columns:1fr}.toolbar{align-items:stretch;flex-wrap:wrap}.toolbar>code{width:100%;order:3}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}</style></body></html>
